# Language pattern enforcement

Before editing code, read and follow the relevant pattern skill:

| Glob | Skill to load |
|------|---------------|
| `*.ts`, `*.tsx` | `typescript-patterns` — and `react-patterns` if JSX/components |
| `*.go` | `go-patterns` |
| `*.rs` | `rust-patterns` |
| `*.py` | `python-patterns` |

These skills define conventions for this workspace. Always read the skill file before making changes.
